[P8] SUMMARY
  V_inf = tan^2(theta/2)/36 : confirmed by B->inf numerics and by the exact series (P2,P3)
  exact series: Psi(B) = 1 - 2/(15B) + O(B^-2)   => Psi < 1, increasing to 1 from below
  sup Psi on [1e-4,1e6], 241 pts = 0.99999986666619 at B=1e+06  (Psi->1)
  C1 = 1.581977 (confirmed numerically), E[w^2] <= 3.3279/B^2 (confirmed), A_lip = 29.9512
  C_rig = 6.696 [note range] / 10.046 [true range]
